{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22245","headline":"咏怀 · 白居易","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冉牛与颜渊，卞和与马迁。\n或罹天六极，或被人刑残。\n顾我信爲幸，百骸且完全。\n五十不爲夭，吾今欠数年。\n知分心自足，委顺身常安。\n故虽穷退日，而无戚戚颜。\n昔有荣先生，从事於其间。\n今我不量力，举心欲攀援。\n穷通不由己，欢戚不由天。\n命即无奈何，心可使泰然。\n且务由己者，省躬谅非难。\n勿问由天者，天高难与言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}